Requirement-Analysis
Project Overview
1.1 Project Name
EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant
1.2 Project Type
AI-powered educational assistance system / web or mobile-based learning application.
1.3 Proposed Technology
EduGenie uses Google Gemini as its generative-AI component to provide conversational educational assistance. Gemini can support educational activities such as generating learning material, answering questions, brainstorming, and creating personalized learning experiences. Google for Education 
Depending on the implementation, EduGenie can interact with Gemini through Google's AI services/API. Gemini's API also supports capabilities such as Google Search grounding, code execution, and function calling, although only the capabilities required by EduGenie's scope need to be implemented. Google AI for Developers 
