2. Problem Definition
Students often depend on multiple sources to understand academic topics, clarify doubts, prepare notes, practice questions, and revise before examinations.
Traditional learning systems may provide static educational content, but they do not necessarily provide interactive, personalized, conversational assistance.
EduGenie aims to provide a single AI-powered learning environment where students can:
•	Ask questions using natural language.
•	Receive explanations appropriate to their learning level.
•	Generate summaries and study notes.
•	Generate quizzes and practice questions.
•	Get step-by-step explanations.
•	Ask follow-up questions.
•	Receive personalized study assistance.
•	Interact with an AI tutor through a conversational interface.
The system should act as a learning assistant, rather than simply functioning as a generic chatbot.
