33. Major Use Cases
UC-01: Login
Actor: Student
Precondition: Student has an account.
Main Flow:
1.	Student opens EduGenie.
2.	Student enters credentials.
3.	System validates credentials.
4.	System authenticates student.
5.	Dashboard is displayed.
Alternative Flow:
•	Invalid credentials → display error.
•	Server unavailable → display service error.
________________________________________
UC-02: Ask Question
Actor: Student
Precondition: Student is logged in.
Main Flow:
1.	Student enters question.
2.	Student submits question.
3.	Backend validates request.
4.	Backend constructs appropriate Gemini request.
5.	Gemini generates response.
6.	Backend receives response.
7.	System displays response.
8.	Conversation is stored if history is enabled.
Postcondition: Student receives an AI-generated educational response.
________________________________________
UC-03: Generate Quiz
Actor: Student
Main Flow:
1.	Student selects subject.
2.	Student selects topic.
3.	Student selects difficulty.
4.	Student specifies number of questions.
5.	System requests quiz generation.
6.	Gemini generates questions.
7.	System displays quiz.
8.	Student answers questions.
9.	System evaluates objective answers.
10.	Score and explanations are displayed.
