•	US-05: As a student, I want to see previous conversations so that I can continue my learning.
•	US-06: As a student, I want step-by-step solutions so that I understand how an answer was obtained.
•	US-07: As a student, I want to provide feedback so that poor responses can be identified.
Teacher Stories
