37. System Constraints
Important constraints include:
1.	EduGenie depends on the availability of the Gemini service.
2.	API usage may be subject to quotas, rate limits, and pricing/plan restrictions.
3.	AI-generated answers may contain errors.
4.	Internet connectivity is required for cloud-based AI interaction.
5.	User data must be handled according to applicable privacy requirements.
6.	The project has limited development time and resources.
7.	The quality of AI responses depends partly on prompt design and available model capabilities.
8.	Uploaded documents, if supported, require additional storage and processing controls.
Google's education documentation also notes that Gemini availability and limits can vary by Workspace edition and that AI-generated content can contain mistakes. Google Help 
